{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>White Rats</u></strong> is a visual thriller about survival, memory, and betrayal deep inside an abandoned research facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/extras/14c75e5d858e712356da624df8bae864.avif?t=1754831062\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Story:</strong></u><br>Wake up surrounded by strangers. Time is running out. The system is collapsing. Who are you? Who can you trust? Every decision affects the story, and the characters are far more complex than they first appear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man wakes up in a mysterious underground dungeon. He remembers nothing \u2014 not even his name. Next to him lies a girl with a gun. She mistakes him for a kidnapper. In the end, they join forces to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/extras/cddc931fc20b20931e7d7b71f7a2a4d6.avif?t=1754831062\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by &quot;Cube,&quot; &quot;Zero Escape,&quot; and retrofuturistic aesthetics, White Rats combines cinematic storytelling, a dark atmosphere, and gripping narrative. Are you ready to uncover the truth \u2014 or will you become just another part of the experiment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/extras/c912026ca1b5a1b8e5f946bb2e3fd82d.avif?t=1754831062\" width=2048 height=1152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Gameplay features:</strong></u><br>In White Rats, you will play as multiple protagonists.<br>In Episode One, they are Rid and Anna \u2014 two young people who woke up together in a mysterious underground bunker.<br>To survive, you\u2019ll need to:<br>1. Explore the dungeon to find an exit.<br>2. Discover and combine useful items.<br>3. Fight! \u2013 The game features a QTE combat system.<br>4. Solve puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/extras/cde2064379b049032b9bdf2105c03e5e.avif?t=1754831062\" width=2048 height=1152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Episode 1 \u2013 Awakening:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode, Awakening, you\u2019ll meet only a small part of the UF-44 station's inhabitants. Estimated playtime is 1\u20133 hours. <br><br>Don\u2019t forget to share your thoughts in the official VK community!<br>If you find any bugs \u2014 report them to Zlobster right away!<br>Enjoy the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835230?t=1754831062","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/103bba32005cfb647c5cc26b22f0d8aac4b6d515/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754831062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/3bc0b78bcbb5f039f838c8b5822a1895816efc56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754831062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/3bc0b78bcbb5f039f838c8b5822a1895816efc56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754831062","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game includes scenes of stylized blood and violence, murder, the use of cold weapons and firearms, and tobacco smoking. All visuals are depicted in an anime-inspired art style. The game does not contain sexual content, non-consensual acts, drug use, or self-harm.\r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3835240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>White Rats</u></strong> is a visual thriller about survival, memory, and betrayal deep inside an abandoned research facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/extras/14c75e5d858e712356da624df8bae864.avif?t=1754831062\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Story:</strong></u><br>Wake up surrounded by strangers. Time is running out. The system is collapsing. Who are you? Who can you trust? Every decision affects the story, and the characters are far more complex than they first appear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man wakes up in a mysterious underground dungeon. He remembers nothing \u2014 not even his name. Next to him lies a girl with a gun. She mistakes him for a kidnapper. In the end, they join forces to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/extras/cddc931fc20b20931e7d7b71f7a2a4d6.avif?t=1754831062\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by &quot;Cube,&quot; &quot;Zero Escape,&quot; and retrofuturistic aesthetics, White Rats combines cinematic storytelling, a dark atmosphere, and gripping narrative. Are you ready to uncover the truth \u2014 or will you become just another part of the experiment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/extras/c912026ca1b5a1b8e5f946bb2e3fd82d.avif?t=1754831062\" width=2048 height=1152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Gameplay features:</strong></u><br>In White Rats, you will play as multiple protagonists.<br>In Episode One, they are Rid and Anna \u2014 two young people who woke up together in a mysterious underground bunker.<br>To survive, you\u2019ll need to:<br>1. Explore the dungeon to find an exit.<br>2. Discover and combine useful items.<br>3. Fight! \u2013 The game features a QTE combat system.<br>4. Solve puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/extras/cde2064379b049032b9bdf2105c03e5e.avif?t=1754831062\" width=2048 height=1152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Episode 1 \u2013 Awakening:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode, Awakening, you\u2019ll meet only a small part of the UF-44 station's inhabitants. Estimated playtime is 1\u20133 hours. <br><br>Don\u2019t forget to share your thoughts in the official VK community!<br>If you find any bugs \u2014 report them to Zlobster right away!<br>Enjoy the game!</p>","developers":["Zlobster"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835230/00adf4358bccb66c0531f5ae16343c34d4289d4d/header.jpg?t=1754831062","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04+ or compatible<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5 GHz Dual